OL,3,ATrump's Board of Peace unveils $2.45bn
OL,4,AGaza recovery plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump's Board of
OL,7,FPeace has announced a $2.45bn (#1.85bn)
OL,8,FGaza recovery plan at a meeting on the
OL,9,Fsidelines of the UN General Assembly.
OL,11,FThe funding will be spread across 66
OL,12,Fprogrammes over six months, and
OL,13,Fdirected at housing, diesel generation
OL,14,Fand waste removal, among other needs.
OL,16,FBut the board admitted substantial
OL,17,Fdonations were still needed, with $18bn
OL,18,Fpledged but only $280m handed over so
OL,19,Ffar. It estimates full recovery and
OL,20,Freconstruction will require about $71bn
OL,21,Fover the next decade.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
