OL,3,ATrump's Board of Peace unveils $2.45bn
OL,4,AGaza recovery plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe board also did not set out a date
OL,7,Ffor the start of reconstruction in
OL,8,FGaza, where Trump's plan to end the war
OL,9,Fhas largely stalled almost a year after
OL,10,FIsrael and Hamas agreed a ceasefire.
